docs/research/canon-decisions/0064-co-presence-field-condition-disposition.md:353:Joint-passage test (ADR-0044 lines 98-99: *"A primitive enters the grammar by passing two conditions jointly"*) NOT MET for slug / property / sub-stratification admission. Per ADR-0048 parsimony-as-earning-test-outcome-not-axiom discipline, canon does not force admission — but also does not force pure decline when operational reality is genuinely partial and dual-mode.
