docs/research/canon-decisions/0056-phase-2c-semantic-refactoring-bundle.md:147:- **R-ZI-1 (zoom-invariance downstream)**: Scope-recurrence framing in downstream docs (synthesis notes, research notes) may still invoke "self-similarity" or "fractal" language; this ADR does not audit those. Scope-conditioning discipline (ADR-0032) should govern if those surface in subsequent reviews.
