docs/research/canon-decisions/0062-membrane-as-self-produced-disposition.md:12:  ADR-0062 executes the dedicated earning-test evaluation ADR-0053 deferred. Step 0.5 audit evaluated eight per-instance-family operational cases against the two-condition primitive earning-test inherited from ADR-0044/0048/0049/0050: (Q-a) does `membrane-as-self-produced` specify a protocol surface with defined inputs, outputs, and governance; (Q-b) does it have operational implementations across Spore's instance families (BKC/Octo bioregional stewardship, Poietic Match pair-matching, personal-operator configurations, federation-protocol substrate) at identifiably different scales. Aggregate case classification: **2 autopoiesis-active-supporting** (BKC commons-membrane STRONG, IC memory-stewardship-membrane MODERATE) / **3 passive-boundary-supporting** (federation-protocol-version-membrane STRONG, governance-artifact-scope STRONG, spec-DAG-node-boundary STRONG) / **3 ambiguous** (Octo agent-membrane tilts active; federation-member-membership-membrane mixed; PM `pm:CommitmentBundle` boundary tilts passive). Tradition support exceeds the ≥2 threshold per reading: autopoiesis-active reading cites Maturana-Varela 1972 canonical + Bollier-Helfrich commons-as-self-produced (ADR-0053 permeability citation lineage) + Thompson 4E tertiary; passive-boundary reading cites ADR-0041 text-authoritative discipline + Ostrom descriptive boundary analysis.
docs/research/canon-decisions/0062-membrane-as-self-produced-disposition.md:14:  Earning-test verdict: (Q-a) MARGINAL — `membrane-as-self-produced` names a production-mode (how the membrane arises) rather than a new coordination operation with independent governance. Proposed operations (`reproduce-membrane`, `maintain-boundary-through-labor`) are outcomes of existing reproductive-commoning (ADR-0002) and care-commoning (ADR-0045) doctrines rather than distinct protocol surfaces. Unlike ADR-0049's Reproduction-continuity Q-a marginality (where "the thinness IS the invisibilization phenomenon" was a load-bearing Federicist argument because reproductive labor IS structurally invisible and naming-it creates protocol-surface for that invisible work), `membrane-as-self-produced` does not carry the same claim: the labor-visibility dimension is already canon-named at doctrine-lens level. (Q-b) PARTIAL — two genuine autopoiesis-active cases with three clear counterexamples does not match the ADR-0049/0050 admission standard (four-plus strong cases), but also does not fail as structurally as ADR-0061's Q4 failure across all candidates. The joint-passage test (ADR-0044 lines 98-99: *"A primitive enters the grammar by passing two conditions jointly"*) is not met for slug or property admission.
docs/research/canon-decisions/0062-membrane-as-self-produced-disposition.md:22:  ADR-0062 establishes **primitive-bullet scope-conditioning** as a new canon-shift pattern, analogous to ADRs-0031/0032/0044 universality-overreach scope-conditioning at Core Thesis level but applied at primitive-bullet level. The pattern shape: when a concept's operational evidence applies to a scoped subset of a primitive's instances, extend the primitive bullet with explicit scope clauses (principled-rule preferred over enumerated-instance-family, with examples parenthetical to the rule) rather than forcing admit/decline. Future parked-candidate dispositions that fail the joint-passage earning test but carry genuine partial operational support can use this shape.
docs/research/canon-decisions/0062-membrane-as-self-produced-disposition.md:43:authorized-by: "operator directive 2026-04-23 ADR-0062 Step-2 decision-gate: Option (g) adopt-with-scope-conditioning + sub-options principled-rule (ongoing-commoning-labor-constituted vs. text-authoritative-declarative with 2-3 parenthetical examples per side) + slug-inclusion=no/v12. Rationale per operator: earning-test Q-a marginal + Q-b partial does not jointly pass admission standard, but concept is operationally real for some cases (BKC, IC) AND not for others (spec-DAG, governance-artifact, protocol-version); honest disposition is scope-conditioning, not all-or-nothing admit/decline. (a)/(c) over-claim by admitting as canonical for all membranes when true for only some; (d) loses positive articulation of genuine BKC/IC cases; (e) preserves articulation but doesn't establish primitive-bullet scope-conditioning precedent; (f) park rejected because evidence is present now, not future. (g) honors operational reality + establishes new canon-method pattern. Field-Membrane internal-consistency tension acknowledged but not load-bearing (Field is Ostromian-constitutive, not Maturana-Varela autopoietic — so cross-primitive asymmetry on autopoiesis-active reading is acceptable). Method-precedent contribution: primitive-bullet scope-conditioning as new canon-shift pattern analogous to ADRs-0031/0032/0044 universality-overreach at Core Thesis level, now applied at primitive-bullet level. Four canon-object-class inventory preserved — this ADR does NOT introduce a new category; it uses scope-conditioning prose at primitive-bullet level."
