docs/research/canon-decisions/0047-power-multi-layer-decomposition.md:58:The Phase 1 coherence-and-falsifiability audit (`tmp/canon-coherence-falsifiability-audit-2026-04-22.md`) and the corpus-foundational-review-v1 capstone (`docs/research/corpus-review/research-capstone.md`) both surfaced Power/Authority as a Phase 3b-deferred item. Phase 3 (ADR-0044) enumerated Power alongside Care and Norms in the Phase 3b deferral list. Phase 3b.1 (ADR-0045) closed Care via Option F (third cross-cutting doctrine). Phase 3b.2 (ADR-0046) closed Norms via Option B (Field rule-level stratification). Phase 3b.3 closes Power/Authority.
