docs/research/canon-decisions/0051-relational-identity-holon-property.md:145:- **ADR-0016 (field-holon-primitive-distinction):** extended via prose (second extension after 3b.5a's irreducibility clause; file unchanged). Relational-identity is added as Holon property alongside the irreducibility clause. Canon-review-protocol prose-extension pattern (prior precedents: ADR-0044→ADR-0032 supersession-by-prose; ADR-0050→ADR-0016 irreducibility extension).
