docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-04-from-autopoiesis-to-living-coherence-a-maturanan-biological-framework.md:65:6. **Organism–microbe–niche unity as holonic relation** [pdf-p10-11 §6] — verbatim: "The organism–microbe–niche unity is a **holonic relation** in the precise sense that it is both a distinguishable whole and a participant in wider ecological and evolutionary coherences. Its wholeness is not static or hierarchical; it is relational, historical, and operational." Dysbiosis reframed as "disturbed pattern of host–microbe–niche coupling" — not simply "bad bacteria." Healing may require microbial intervention BUT also restoration of diet, rhythm, movement, sleep, relational safety, ecological exposure, immune tolerance. **Connects to Spore's Holon primitive (ADR-0044) + holon-irreducibility property (ADR-0050)**: structural-isomorphism with whole-not-reducible-to-aggregation-of-parts. Descriptive only.
docs/research/2026-04-03/deep-research-prompt-2026-04.md:18:Spore is an infrastructure for collective agency — a common grammar for plural, sovereign coordination across scales and scopes. It develops and publishes **Agent Commons**: a pattern language, protocol family, and governance-memory layer.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-emails/2026-01-25-life-as-viability-under-constraint-a-non-equilibrium-information-theoretic.md:86:By making explicit the constraints implicit in many existing theories, this work offers a shared grammar for understanding life, fragility, and responsibility across scales. Its value lies not in replacing domain-specific models, but in clarifying what no living system can afford to violate if it is to endure.
docs/research/2026-04-03/podcast-context-spore-agent-commons.md:15:Spore is an infrastructure for collective agency — a common grammar for plural, sovereign coordination across scales and scopes. The formal name for the protocol family is Agent Commons. Spore is the project that develops, tests, and publishes it.
docs/research/2026-04-03/podcast-context-spore-agent-commons.md:71:Spore is a common grammar for plural, sovereign coordination across scales. It helps people, agents, and collectives coordinate coherently without flattening difference.
docs/research/2026-04-03/podcast-context-spore-agent-commons.md:78:- **Pattern language** = named recurring arrangements of primitives that metabolize tension across scales (the idioms)
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-01-25-life-as-viability-under-constraint-a-non-equilibrium-information-theoretic.md:35:- **§5 Viability Geometry: State Space, Constraints, Failure** (p20-22): §5.1 state space + admissible trajectories, §5.2 viability as bounded region, §5.3 weakest-link dynamics + multiplicative constraint satisfaction, §5.4 absorbing boundaries + irreversibility, §5.5 option space + recoverability, §5.6 viability geometry as basis for universality
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-01-25-life-as-viability-under-constraint-a-non-equilibrium-information-theoretic.md:53:> "Living systems — from cells and organisms to institutions and ecosystems — often appear stable until they fail abruptly. Existing theories explain aspects of this behavior but lack a shared formal language for persistence, fragility, and collapse across scales. This paper develops a constraint-first framework that treats life as the capacity to remain within a bounded region of state space under non-equilibrium conditions."
docs/research/2026-04-03/chatgpt-deep-research-prompt-2026-04.md:30:- Spore is a coordination grammar and pattern language for plural, sovereign coordination across scales.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-11-the-grammar-of-viability-mind-self-meaning-and-the-conditions-of-enduring-life.md:74:> "The book concludes that understanding itself can function as an adaptive capacity — if it remains disciplined by constraint, responsive to feedback, and integrated across scales. *The Grammar of Viability* offers not certainty or prediction, but orientation: a way to recognize what cannot be ignored, what must be integrated, and what it means to keep futures open."
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-emails/2026-04-19-the-architecture-of-coherence-reintegrating-biological-relational-and.md:117:Finally, the concept of a “field of coherence” is introduced to describe the emergent alignment of systems across scales. Such a field arises not from centralized design, but from the integration of aligned practices, structures, and narratives. Its maintenance depends on continuous feedback, adaptive capacity, and the sustained enhancement of life conditions.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-02-from-entanglement-to-governance-the-geometry-of-coherence-across-scales.md:174:**Comparison to Spore's 9-primitive grammar**: Sahely's 7 Fano-roles operate at a *fundamentally different abstraction layer* than Spore's primitives. Spore primitives (field/holon/membrane structural + intent/commitment/joint-commitment/evidence/signal/reproduction verbs) are operational-coordination-grammar primitives; Sahely's 7 roles (constraint/margin/state/disturbance/perception/regulation/options) are *minimal-relational-roles forced by triadic-closure under Fano geometry*. **Spore's primitives are not derived from a closure-uniqueness argument** (per ADR-0044 they earn their place via cross-tradition convergence + ADR-0048 parsimony-as-earning-test-outcome). The two grammars are *compositionally-comparable but structurally-distinct*; bridge-note authoring (Phase 2 anchor #5) will articulate the relationship without forcing 1:1 mapping.
docs/research/connections/platform-cooperativism-constructive.md:106:- **Criterion 4 (glocal organizational structure).** Local autonomy (per subsidiarity, see `cosmo-local-production`) plus global coordination (federation-protocol, shared canon). This criterion is the governance-structure-level statement of the cosmo-local subsidiarity principle — decisions defer to the lowest competent scale, the federation coordinates across scales, and no federation-participant holds authority higher than necessary for the specific coordination function it serves.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-emails/2026-04-21-toward-a-coherence-physiology-integrating-interfacial-water-mechanobiology.md:112:Taken together, these lines of work support a reframing of chronic illness as defensive lock-in across the continuum of organismal regulation. Mechanical strain, impaired interstitial and vascular flow, microvascular dysfunction, mitochondrial defensive reprogramming, persistent innate immune activation, neuroendocrine disruption, and incomplete recovery are no longer seen as separate categories but as mutually reinforcing dimensions of a broader coherence failure. The term coherence is used here not as metaphorical flourish but as a disciplined description of coordinated force transmission, exchange, signaling, boundary regulation, and adaptive energetic allocation across scales. When these relationships degrade, the organism does not simply develop isolated symptoms; it loses the ability to resolve perturbation and complete recovery. The consequence is a wide range of chronic multisystem syndromes whose diversity reflects local expression within a common regulatory crisis.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-30-the-poetics-of-life-coherence-beauty-ritual-grief-and-the-tempo-of-living.md:200:- **Life-Coherence** — "The pattern of relation through which life-capacity is preserved, restored, and expanded across scales. Life-coherence is not a static harmony, but an ongoing process of relation, repair, timing, and answerability to life."
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2018-02-14-the-primary-axiom-of-value-universal-human-economy.md:28:- The nine grounds of "unlimited validity of the P-Axiom" (self-evidence, universality, presupposition, objectivity, impartiality, completeness, sovereignty, measurability, contingent pattern)
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-03-22-from-coherence-to-viability-a-geometry-of-living-systems-chatgpt5-3-notebooklm.md:61:> "The framework is further formalized through a hierarchy of invariants: pairwise compatibility (ω), triadic coherence (N3), and global viability (I4). Together, these define necessary conditions for system persistence across scales."
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-03-22-from-coherence-to-viability-a-geometry-of-living-systems-chatgpt5-3-notebooklm.md:99:> "This multi-scale perspective aligns with observations across domains, where failures often occur not because of isolated breakdowns, but because of **misalignment across scales**."
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-07-the-grammar-of-viability-diagnosing-the-limits-of-measurement-preserving.md:62:> "The trilogy is therefore *fibered* because its central concern — viability — does not reside in what is measured, but in what must be preserved beneath measurement. The same structure recurs across scales. The electron, the patient, and the nation each exhibit a base of observables, a fiber of coherence, and invariant constraints that regulate admissible interaction between them."
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-emails/2026-04-30-the-biology-of-love-as-the-grammar-of-life-coherence-from-molecular-autopoiesis.md:168:This grammar can be applied across scales: bacteria, cells, bodies, persons, families, schools, communities, societies, civilizations, and the biosphere–anthroposphere unity. It is domain-invariant in form but domain-specific in operation.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-emails/2026-05-03-toward-a-medicine-of-living-coherence-chatgpt-5-5-thinking-and-notebooklm.md:245:AI should not convert living persons into data objects or risk profiles detached from context. Its proper role is to help clinicians, patients, communities, and policymakers identify patterns across scales: clinical history, medications, biomarkers, symptoms, social determinants, environmental exposures, service gaps, treatment burden, recurrence, recovery, and uncertainty.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-emails/2026-02-11-the-grammar-of-viability-mind-self-meaning-and-the-conditions-of-enduring-life.md:94:The book concludes that understanding itself can function as an adaptive capacity — if it remains disciplined by constraint, responsive to feedback, and integrated across scales. The Grammar of Viability offers not certainty or prediction, but orientation: a way to recognize what cannot be ignored, what must be integrated, and what it means to keep futures open.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-emails/2026-04-13-the-architecture-of-viability-how-coherence-emerges-from-mind-to-society-and.md:147:The framework extends across scales:
docs/research/connections/sahely-entanglement-to-governance.md:167:- **F6.4 scale-transition** is exactly the canonical territory Sahely's sheaf-machinery formalizes: scale-transition failures are *gluing failures across scales*. The Sahely framing offers `epistemic-gap` (ADR-0076 slug, F5 trigger-surface) a deeper structural interpretation — gaps as cohomological-obstruction-signatures rather than as bare divergences.
docs/research/connections/johar-recursive-intelligence.md:39:The essay proposes **recursive intelligence** as the capacity required instead: "the capacity to iteratively re-enter and revise one's own frames, across scales and epistemic states, under conditions of feedback and transformation." This is not the rejection of abstraction but the discipline that governs abstraction under conditions of change.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-emails/2026-04-27-the-field-of-viability-framework-a-relational-life-course-model-of-health-well.md:109:The second shift is from health as normality to health as viability. Viability means the capacity to remain alive, adaptive, responsive, coherent, and capable under changing conditions. A viable person can absorb disturbance without collapse, recover after injury, develop across the life course, maintain meaningful relationships, participate in community, and access real options for flourishing. This idea can also be extended across scales: families, communities, institutions, ecosystems, and societies can be more or less viable depending on whether they preserve or erode the conditions for life-capacity.
