docs/project-vision.md:31:    - *Authority-over-rule-levels* (ADR-0047 Layer 1): capacity-to-set, capacity-to-amend, and capacity-to-enforce rules at each level is distributed across participants, roles, and positions — enumerated-powers-by-role pattern (Debian §4/§5/§6; PEP 13 Steering Council; Apache PMC vs. Board) and polycentric-governance (V. Ostrom 1972; Aligica-Tarko 2012).
