tmp/canon-first-principles-audit-v2-2026-04-22.md:61:**Consolidated v2**: Opus-4-7's three-primitive (Intent/Commitment/Evidence) reduction is the cleanest. The six-element chain becomes one coordination grammar among several; Vision + Roadmap + Learning become artifact-types that some coordination contexts author. The three-layer coordination stack (reproduction/production/governance per ADR-0004) should be surfaced more prominently as the actual architecture, with the ecology being a slice of the production layer. Confidence: **medium-high**.
tmp/canon-first-principles-audit-v2-2026-04-22.md:249:Spore's real achievement is the self-evolution machinery (canon-review protocol, learning-membrane, bridge-notes, held-tensions). The object-level coordination grammar is thinner. Honest positioning: "Spore has built a way of producing coordination vocabularies, not (yet) a definitive coordination vocabulary." This reframes what specification-voice is appropriate for.
tmp/canon-first-principles-audit-v2-2026-04-22.md:337:- **Coordination Ecology**: relabel as "Spore's discovery-mode coordination grammar" (Codex) or "one coordination grammar among several" (Lens O). Name alternatives (stigmergic, ritual, embedded-care, conversational) as co-equal.
tmp/adr-0073-f1-audit-manifest-2026-04-25.md:223:Operator-ratified unified scope says F1 covers all three. Doctrinal framing must abstract across modalities via **principled-rule** (like ADR-0062 Membrane production-mode scope-conditioning) rather than listing per-modality tables. Doctrine operates at "coordination grammar of sensor-oracle governance" layer; per-modality operational specifics belong to F4 (representation-authority), F5 (actuator-logic), or pattern/protocol layer.
