docs/research/connections/sahely-systems-immunology.md:49:**Caveat (read first):** This is the Spore-side substrate-grammar map for Bichara Sahely's 2026-05-15 paper *"Life-Coherent Systems Immunology: Reseeing Chronic Immune Disease as Organism–Niche Phase-Locking"* (288pp; AI-co-authored with ChatGPT-5.5 Thinking + NotebookLM). This is **Wave 3 anchor #9 in the post-DECISION-BRIEF intake**, calibrated per operator dispatch §13.3 to surface (a) C3 R-McMurtry-substrate at organism-immunity scale (UHLN extending to bodily-integrity territory); (b) C2 R-Care-as-structural-coupling at body-care/healing layer; (c) C10 R-Health-as-coherent-transition substantive composition substrate. The DECISION-BRIEF (`tmp/sahely-corpus-canon-pressure-decision-brief-2026-05-22.md`) has already been operator-ratified with Bundle β + per-candidate dispositions (C1/C3/C6 admit; C2/C12/C13 scope-condition; C5/C8/C9/C10/C11/C14 framing-note-only; C7 decline-with-trigger; D1+D2 carry-forward declines). This bridge note's R-claims therefore carry framing-note-only dispositions that **deepen** ratified admit-substrate and scope-condition substrate rather than surfacing new admission-pressure. Per the 3-layer separation discipline (`feedback_intake_to_vocab_admission_program.md`), this is Layer 1.5 substrate-deepening; no canon-body edits; no commits from this artifact alone.
