docs/research/synthesis/coherence-without-collapse-and-its-projections.md:28:Companion / source reading (this doc points to, rather than duplicates): the vault doc *Sheaf Theory — Living Coherence, Hypergraph Sheaves, and Bioregional Regeneration*; **sheaf.lol** (pedagogy); `spore.connection.hansen-ghrist-discourse-graphs`; `spore.connection.zhao-async-nonlinear-sheaf-diffusion`; `docs/research/planning/sheaf-experiment-deferral.md` (the discipline that gates all of this); `spore.synthesis.compositional-field-architecture` (the sibling synthesis).
