docs/research/connections/johar-infrastructure-after-permanence.md:39:For Spore, this frames the grammar's adaptive design not as a preference but as a response to the categorical failure of permanence assumptions. The coordination grammar operates in the same post-permanence condition: commitments must be revisable, governance must be responsive, and the measure of success is coherence through change, not persistence of plan.
