docs/research/2026-04-03/podcast-context-spore-agent-commons.md:17:Why "Spore"? A spore is portable, generative, and context-sensitive: it moves through larger living networks, lands in a place, and unfolds locally. The same logic applies here — a shared coordination grammar that can be adopted across projects, grow in different forms, and remain interoperable without requiring centralization.
