docs/research/connections/sahely-natural-drift-to-living-coherence.md:32:**Caveat (read first):** This is a Spore-side substrate-resonance bridge note for Bichara Sahely's 2026-05-05 working-draft white paper *"From Natural Drift to Evolutionary Living Coherence: A Maturanan Framework for Evo-Devo, Niche Construction, Symbiosis, Inheritance, and Population Genetics"* (28-page PDF; bsahely.com blog post; AI-co-authored with ChatGPT GPT-5.5 Thinking + NotebookLM). It is a **descriptive, framing-note-only** comparative-intake artifact at Layer 1.5 of the intake program (`feedback_intake_to_vocab_admission_program.md`). It **admits nothing.** Per single-source rigor, Sahely is one AI-co-authored author corpus within a Maturanan tradition; cross-post recurrence inside that corpus is **not** independent evidence and is not summed here as convergence. Post-Bundle-α canon is cited in its resolved state (concepts-yaml v24; 4 cross-cutting doctrines; 40 canon-decisions through ADR-0090). Cross-repo §5 is descriptive comparison only per stream-scope discipline (`feedback_workstream_scope_discipline.md`); it makes no write-side recommendation.
