docs/research/connections/sahely-eco-genocidal-system-violence.md:39:**FOUNDATION-ERA note:** This is a **2017–2018 pre-AI-collaboration** post — it predates the Dec-2022+ AI-co-authored white-paper explosion (the 2026 *Grammar of Violence* / *Global Projections (Galtung)* notes are the AI-co-authored elaborations of this same seed). It is a short Sahely-original essay that **quotes** primary sources (Galtung via Farmer; McMurtry; a Libya article) and connects them with original framing; it is **not** a repost. Single-source rigor applies with extra force here: the post's analytic weight is carried by the embedded primary authors' words, and Sahely's contribution is the connective synthesis (financial sanctions/austerity as *structural* WMD; mass-media ideological filtering as *cultural* WMD; both serving "the multiplying money-cancer class"). This is a Phase-3 lighter-ceremony bridge note in the Sahely intake program (Phase 1 closed 2026-05-22; Phase 2 Bundle α closed 2026-05-29).
