tmp/wave-9-raw-md/2026-04-04-the-field-of-coherence-navigation-integration-and-participation-in-complex.md:9471:What appeared as separate concepts now reveals itself as a single, continuous process. ~ _Figure 12. The Coherence Loop: From Grammar to Living Practice_ The full cycle of coherence unfolds as a recursive process: from relational grammar to field interaction, through distortion, detection, and failure, toward restored coherence, informed design, calibrated intervention, and embodied practice. This loop is not linear but continuous, with each iteration deepening understanding and participation. Grammar → Structure → Field → Distortion → Detection 303 
