tmp/wave-9-raw-md/2026-04-04-the-field-of-coherence-navigation-integration-and-participation-in-complex.md:10716:Throughout his practice, Dr. Sahely developed a deep interest in how systems fail — not as isolated events, but as processes unfolding across interacting variables, delayed signals, and constrained decision-making. This led to the development of the **Viability Grammar** , a relational framework for understanding how systems maintain or lose coherence. 
