docs/research/connections/johar-infrastructure-agility.md:27:1. **Grammar as infrastructure for coordination agility:** Spore's coordination grammar — commitment protocols, discourse graph, holon architecture — is the infrastructure that makes adaptive coordination possible. Without it, agents must carry all their own coordination overhead, becoming heavier and less agile. The essay makes this structural argument explicit for physical infrastructure.
