docs/research/connections/sahely-life-coherent-framework-health.md:42:**Caveat (read first):** This is a Spore-side substrate-resonance bridge note for Bichara Sahely's 2026-05-10 academic white paper *"A Life-Coherent Framework for Health, Healing, and Human Flourishing: From Root Causes to Life-Enabling Action"* (218 pages; bsahely.com blog post + companion PDF; AI-co-authored with ChatGPT GPT-5.5 Thinking + NotebookLM, with authorship retained by Sahely per §1 below). It is a **descriptive, framing-note-only** comparative-intake artifact at Layer 1.5 of the intake program. Per Phase-3 discipline it surfaces resonance against the *already-resolved* post-Bundle-α canon (concepts-yaml v24; 4 cross-cutting doctrines; canon-rebuild arc at 40 canon-decisions through ADR-0090) — it makes **no admission proposal** and surfaces **no inline canon-pressure**. Single-source rigor: Sahely is one AI-co-authored author corpus, and cross-post recurrence within that corpus is **not** independent evidence; this note does not claim cross-tradition convergence on the strength of Sahely alone. Cross-repo §5 is descriptive comparison only per stream-scope discipline — it makes no write-side recommendation for IC/bregion/BKC/PM.
