docs/research/connections/sheaf-substrate-multi-source-synthesis.md:430:The operator-authored sheaf-explorer ([sheaf.lol](https://sheaf.lol); repo at `~/projects/sheaf-explorer`) provides a visual, interactive introduction to sheaf theory with explicit Spore connection. Per the repo README:
docs/research/connections/sheaf-substrate-multi-source-synthesis.md:436:Sahely's framework has no pedagogical articulation in Spore substrate. **Sahely's framings could enhance sheaf.lol pedagogy** if integrated with attribution discipline (see §7 below for candidate integration sites).
docs/research/connections/sheaf-substrate-multi-source-synthesis.md:454:Per Sahely C-6 + Ch 1 *Reality Without Objects* + Ch 2 *The Minimal Grammar of Coherence*: *don't try to engineer coherence directly. Engineer the structural prerequisites — triadic closure on relational roles, gluing-discipline across local sections, monitoring of cohomological-obstruction-rise as the early-warning signal. Coherence is what emerges when those prerequisites hold; it cannot be installed directly.*
