docs/research/connections/sheaf-substrate-multi-source-synthesis.md:677:Per operator preference (2026-05-30): *"i would like to update our sheaf explorer (sheaf.lol) with our learnings and research from Sahely, if it would enhance and improve the explorer and fill gaps. with regard to his framing and claims, we want to be clear that they are his and not ours, other than what we adopted from his work via our learning membranes for spore"*.
