docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-22-emotional-sentience-as-relational-architecture-from-kauffmans-ascent-to-the.md:26:**Strongest sheaf-substrate signal in Wave 1 outside #1**: 4-level methodological proposal — Grammar / Algebra / Geometry / Dynamics — with Geometry layer covering "topology of intrinsic freedom" via Phase / Fibre (Hopf fibration explicit in keywords). Appendix B is a **dedicated Mathematical Primer on Fano + Octonions + Triality + Albert + FTS + E7**.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-22-emotional-sentience-as-relational-architecture-from-kauffmans-ascent-to-the.md:35:- **§5** — From Grammar to Dynamics (p23) — fourfold formal roadmap
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-22-emotional-sentience-as-relational-architecture-from-kauffmans-ascent-to-the.md:53:Figures emphasize: Kauffman's Ascent (Fig 1), Relational-Exceptional Ladder (Fig 2), Mutual Illumination Map (Fig 3), Grammar→Dynamics (Fig 4), Subjectivity/Distinction/Triality (Fig 6), **Phase/Fibre/Möbius/Torus (Fig 7)**, Genealogy of Formal Worlds (Fig 9), Coherence/Breakdown (Fig 11).
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-22-emotional-sentience-as-relational-architecture-from-kauffmans-ascent-to-the.md:55:Tables emphasize: Kauffman concepts ↔ formal needs (Table 4), Emotional sentience across Grammar/Algebra/Geometry/Dynamics (Table 5), **Triality and Irreducible Modes of Presentation (Table 6)**, Phase/Fibre/Topological Enrichment (Table 7), **Magic Square Family Genealogy (Table 9)**, Mutual Illumination Made Explicit (Table 10), **Octonionic and Exceptional Features Relevant to Emotional Sentience (Table 11)**, Coherence/Dysregulation/Transformation (Table 12), Claims by Strength: Textual/Formal/Interpretive (Table 13).
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-22-emotional-sentience-as-relational-architecture-from-kauffmans-ascent-to-the.md:68:### C-4 (p4, Abstract) — **4-level formal scaffolding: Grammar / Algebra / Geometry / Dynamics (LOAD-BEARING)**
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-22-emotional-sentience-as-relational-architecture-from-kauffmans-ascent-to-the.md:69:> "The central methodological proposal of the paper is that emotional sentience can be interpreted through four progressively richer formal levels: **grammar, algebra, geometry, and dynamics**. **Grammar** specifies primitive distinctions and lawful closure; **algebra** specifies context-sensitive composition and oriented meaning; **geometry** specifies structured state and disclosed world; and **dynamics** specifies transformation, anticipation, and whole-system coherence across time. The paper argues that emotional sentience is therefore best understood not as a catalog of feeling-states or as a scalar accompaniment to cognition, but as the lived signature of a multilevel relational architecture linking distinction, meaning, state, transformation, and coherence."
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-22-emotional-sentience-as-relational-architecture-from-kauffmans-ascent-to-the.md:120:1. **C-4 4-level formal scaffolding (Grammar/Algebra/Geometry/Dynamics)** is structurally adjacent to Spore's canon object-class inventory (primitives / doctrines / modes / properties). Sahely's 4 layers are not 1:1 with Spore's 4 categories but the *progressive-formal-enrichment* shape (grammar → algebra → geometry → dynamics) parallels Spore's ratchet (primitives → modes → properties → patterns → doctrines).
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-09-life-coherent-civilization-from-world-bringing-to-participatory-repair.md:49:5. **"World-bringing animal" as foundational anthropology** [pdf-p3 ToC §1.1-1.10 + Part I title "The Foundational Grammar"] — verbatim Chapter 1 title: "**The World-Bringing Animal**". 10 sub-sections covering: "1.1 The human being as an unfinished biological-cultural being / 1.2 Distinction as the beginning of a world / 1.3 Language and the coordination of worlds / 1.4 Institutions as stabilized distinctions / 1.5 Tools, technologies, and the extension of world-bringing / 1.6 The social construction of normality / 1.7 World-bringing and the body / 1.8 World-bringing and ecology / 1.9 The danger of world-blindness / 1.10 From world-bringing to responsibility". Foundational anthropology framing: human beings as participants-in-world-bringing (NOT observers of pre-given world). Maturana's enactive-cognition extended into civilizational diagnosis.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-24-the-grammar-of-violence-structural-drivers-of-systemic-harm-and-pathways-to.md:22:# Extraction Record — The Grammar of Violence: Structural Drivers of Systemic Harm and Pathways to Viability
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-24-the-grammar-of-violence-structural-drivers-of-systemic-harm-and-pathways-to.md:28:**Cluster role**: **Wave-7 ANCHOR — diagnostic violence-cluster substrate**. Extends Wave-1 anchor #7 ("A Single Grammar Across Scale", Feb 9) by applying viability-grammar lens specifically to violence (war / ecological collapse / financial volatility / public-sector erosion as homologous outputs of one architecture). Integrates two primary-source theoretical lineages: **Galtung (1990 violence triangle / 1996 U.S. pathologies / 2013 DMA-vs-HDT)** + **McMurtry (2003 war state / 2014 cancer stage of capitalism)** into a unified structural model. Same-day sibling of #4 PHILOSOPHY AND WORLD PROBLEMS (McMurtry-substrate abstract) and #5 Reclaiming-Our-Future (Cancer Economy abstract). Internal-triad with #1 (The Rupture) + #2 (Pathological Military Paradigm — actually McMurtry 1989 REPOSTED). Pairs with same-week #7+#8 monetary-architecture white papers (Feb 27-28) as the diagnostic→prescription axis.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-24-the-grammar-of-violence-structural-drivers-of-systemic-harm-and-pathways-to.md:57:### C-4 (Sahely) — Grammar-level vs event-level analysis
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-22-the-pathological-logic-of-the-military-paradigm-notebooklm.md:38:**Cluster role**: Wave-7 REPOSTED member; substrate-citation backing the **same-day** triad (#1 Rupture / #2 this McMurtry-1989 / #6 Grammar-of-Violence anchor citing McMurtry 2014 + 2003). Sahely surfacing McMurtry's earliest peace-studies work (1989) makes the 35-year arc visible: 1989 *Understanding War* → 1999/2002/2010/2014 *Cancer Stage of Capitalism* → 2003 *Understanding the U.S. War State* (also REPOSTED as #10 in this wave). All four McMurtry works cited or REPOSTED in Wave 7.
docs/research/canon-decisions/0045-care-cross-cutting-doctrine.md:181:- **Foundational-relational register** (Sahely W1.1 *Toward a Maturana-Informed Viability Grammar* 2026-05-21 at `spore.connection.sahely-maturana-viability-grammar`): Maturana's biology of love as "the relational domain in which the other arises as legitimate in coexistence, is not sentimental but foundational" (C-6 LOAD-BEARING claim, pdf-p3 verbatim). The Sahely paper's central diagrammatic figure presents 8 viability-grammar primitives circled around a single central LOVE-as-relational-ground node — structurally distinct from primitives-as-reflective-questions; read in Spore terms, sits in the same canon-shape slot as care-commoning doctrine (cross-cutting, operating beneath/across primitives rather than as a primitive among them).
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-03-10-from-sacred-narrative-to-civilizational-viability-religion-violence-and-the.md:33:**Anchor declaration**: Wave-8 anchor — extends Wave-7 anchor #6 (Grammar of Violence: Decoding the Background Program of Modern Power, 2026-02-24) by adding religion-as-cultural-violence-layer to the prior Galtung-McMurtry violence-triangle substrate. Anchor #6 (Wave-7) named the structural-drivers; anchor #5 (this, Wave-8) names religion as one of those drivers + introduces the **Viability Geometry Model** (constraints / margins / optionality) and **HDT framework** (Holism-Dialectics-Transcendence) as Sahely's signature analytical apparatus. Same-week with #6 (Metanoia and the Historical Jesus, March 12) — together #5 + #6 form the **religion-violence-civilization sub-cluster** within Wave-8.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-03-10-from-sacred-narrative-to-civilizational-viability-religion-violence-and-the.md:63:- Ch 20 Rewriting the Moral Story: A Viability Grammar for Civilization
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-03-10-from-sacred-narrative-to-civilizational-viability-religion-violence-and-the.md:111:- **R-1 — Anchor-extension discipline**: This anchor extends Wave-7 anchor #6 (Grammar of Violence) at the religion-as-cultural-violence layer. Per dispatch: add `EXTENDS` KG edge from this piece → Wave-7 anchor #6, AND `IN_CLUSTER_WITH` edge to Wave-8 #6 (Metanoia / Jesus). Validated structurally: P5 §"Violence as a System" reproduces the Galtung triangle that anchor #6 (Wave-7) introduced, then specializes the cultural-violence vertex into religious symbolic structures (Chs 3-6, 14-20). No contradiction with anchor #6's claims; only deepening.
