docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-27-living-coherence-and-neuropsychiatric-disease-autopoiesis-structural-coupling.md:73:> "The proposed Seven-Primitives Clinical Grammar--Constraint, Margin, State, Disturbance, Perception, Regulation, and Options--offers a disciplined transdiagnostic method for assessing how living coherence breaks down and how it may be restored." [anchor: §Abstract · orn:source:bsahely-2026-05-27-living-coherence-and-neuropsychiatric-di · pdf-p2]
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-27-living-coherence-and-neuropsychiatric-disease-autopoiesis-structural-coupling.md:129:### C-23 (§10 Seven-Primitives, p16) — Grammar complements not replaces diagnosis
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-27-living-coherence-and-neuropsychiatric-disease-autopoiesis-structural-coupling.md:130:> "The seven-primitives grammar translates the life-coherence framework into clinical formulation. It does not replace diagnosis. It provides a way to locate how life has become constrained and where repair may begin. The primitives are: Constraint, Margin, State, Disturbance, Perception, Regulation, and Options." [anchor: §10 The Seven-Primitives Clinical Grammar · orn:source:bsahely-2026-05-27-living-coherence-and-neuropsychiatric-di · pdf-p16]
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-27-living-coherence-and-neuropsychiatric-disease-autopoiesis-structural-coupling.md:158:### Seven-Primitives Clinical Grammar — cycle (Figure 3, p16) with clinical questions
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-27-living-coherence-and-neuropsychiatric-disease-autopoiesis-structural-coupling.md:167:[anchor: §Figure 3 Seven-Primitives Clinical Grammar · pdf-p16]
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-27-living-coherence-and-neuropsychiatric-disease-autopoiesis-structural-coupling.md:182:> "First, stabilize acute risk and identify non-negotiable medical or safety concerns. Second, describe the present state across body, affect, cognition, relation, and meaning without prematurely reducing it to a diagnosis. Third, locate the dominant constraint and margin loss: what is blocked, and what reserve remains? Fourth, identify the current regulatory strategy, even when it is costly: avoidance, compulsion, dissociation, substance use, collapse, expansion, perfectionism, or relational control may all function as attempts to preserve viability. Fifth, name one small option that can be reopened safely. The aim is not to complete a checklist, but to locate where repair can begin without forcing the system beyond its margin." [anchor: §10.1 How to Use the Seven-Primitives Clinical Grammar · pdf-p17]
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-12-circulatory-health-as-a-coherence-system-from-developmental-origins-to-policy.md:33:**Cluster role**: Domain-specific application of the Wave-9 coherence-as-navigation framework to cardiovascular medicine + public health policy. Shorter (32pp) than other Wave-9 posts — operates as a **policy-paper format** demonstrating the framework's translation into a specific clinical-policy application. Cross-cluster bridge between Wave-9 (coherence/viability mathematical framework) and prior Sahely work on health-as-coherence (Wave-7 Grammar-of-Violence health-implications territory).
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-12-circulatory-health-as-a-coherence-system-from-developmental-origins-to-policy.md:91:- **Wave-7 Grammar-of-Violence health-implications cross-cluster link**: Where Wave-7 anchor #6 (Grammar of Violence, Feb 2026) treated structural-violence-as-health-implication, this Wave-9 #7 treats health-as-coherence-system. The two pieces are complementary cuts at the same structural-violence-and-health territory — descriptive RELATES_TO cross-cluster note (NOT strong canon-edge).
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-24-the-invisible-architecture-of-violence-collective-trauma-identity-myth-and-the.md:30:**Cluster role**: Wave-4 broader-cluster; **Galtung-McMurtry violence-cluster ANCHOR**. Same-day published companion to Wave-4 #7 *Grammar of Violence: Decoding the Background Program of Modern Power* (also 2026-02-24). Integrates **Galtung's CMT (Chosenness-Myth-Trauma) framework** + **McMurtry's Ruling Group-Mind concept** to diagnose recursive escalation cycles in advanced democratic societies. Bridges trauma-psychology / cultural-narrative / institutional-cognition / emotional-mobilization into a single recursive-loop framework.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-24-the-invisible-architecture-of-violence-collective-trauma-identity-myth-and-the.md:105:- **Same-day companion to Wave-4 #7 *Grammar of Violence***. Wave-4 #7 = Galtung Direct/Structural/Cultural triangle + Dualistic-Archetype + Ruling-Value-Code applied at power/institutional layer; Wave-4 #8 = Galtung CMT (Chosenness-Myth-Trauma) + Ruling Group-Mind applied at identity/collective-subconscious layer. Read as 2026-02-24 violence-cluster anchor pair.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-24-the-invisible-architecture-of-violence-collective-trauma-identity-myth-and-the.md:106:- **C-11 unconscious-becomes-behavioral** parallels Wave-4 #5 *Grammar of Viability* claim #7 ("Collapse is delayed feedback, not surprise") and Wave-4 #6 *Cost of Staying Alive* C-8 ("living systems cannot indefinitely violate constraint without internalizing the cost") — same arithmetic at psychological vs. biological vs. governance scales: unaddressed constraint-violation accumulates and manifests structurally.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-11-the-grammar-of-viability-mind-self-meaning-and-the-conditions-of-enduring-life.md:22:# Extraction Record — The Grammar of Viability: Mind, Self, Meaning, and the Conditions of Enduring Life
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-11-the-grammar-of-viability-mind-self-meaning-and-the-conditions-of-enduring-life.md:30:**Cluster role**: Wave-4 broader-cluster; **HIGH-density viability-grammar substrate at cognitive scale**. Subtitle "Diagnosing Fragmentation, Recovering Orientation, and Keeping Futures Open" positions this as the cognitive-scale companion to Wave-4 #2's general-audience whitepaper (2026-02-07) and Wave-3 #4's *Unifying Grammar of Viability* (2026-02-12, 118pp, biology-focused). Authored 1 day after Wave-4 #4 *Self as Viability Stack*. Establishes **7 central claims** verbatim — closest single-paper articulation of Sahely's cluster-wide thesis.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-11-the-grammar-of-viability-mind-self-meaning-and-the-conditions-of-enduring-life.md:50:> "Neither reductionist nor mystical, *The Grammar of Viability* reframes soul and spirit as functional realities, diagnoses institutional and cultural failure modes, and offers a disciplined framework for restoring orientation in an era of accelerating constraint. The work does not present a final theory, but a **constraint-faithful lens** capable of integrating knowledge without erasing difference — aimed at preserving coherence where it matters most."
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-11-the-grammar-of-viability-mind-self-meaning-and-the-conditions-of-enduring-life.md:74:> "The book concludes that understanding itself can function as an adaptive capacity — if it remains disciplined by constraint, responsive to feedback, and integrated across scales. *The Grammar of Viability* offers not certainty or prediction, but orientation: a way to recognize what cannot be ignored, what must be integrated, and what it means to keep futures open."
docs/research/canon-decisions/0048-power-expressive-constructed-modes.md:13:  Johar's three-form framework for power (allocational / expressive / constructed; "Power Cannot Be Allocated: Designing Organizations for a Complex World," 2026) identifies a structural gap in ADR-0047: the three-layer decomposition (authority-over-rule-levels + asymmetric-commitment + asymmetric-membrane) captures power's allocational modes exhaustively across the four structural modes capstone §3 named, but leaves expressive power ("life articulating meaning, desire, dissent") and constructed power ("situational agency emerging dynamically in response to what presents itself") structurally invisible. Johar's substitution-trap ("One can assign authority without generating comprehension. One can define responsibility without producing commitment.") lands directly on ADR-0047's allocational framing: pre-allocation of structural capacity does not generate either expressive or constructed capacity. Per operator directive 2026-04-22 (post Phase 3b.3 close-out), Spore canon integrates the full Johar three-form framework by admitting `expressive-power` and `constructed-power` as first-class modes-across-primitives — grammar-level phenomena operating as properties of existing primitives rather than as new primitive categories. Honest parsimony evaluation: expressive and constructed fail the primitive-earning test in project-vision.md (they do not have separable protocol surfaces with defined inputs/outputs/governance); they are qualities and dynamics of the existing coordination grammar. Modes-across-primitives is a first-class canon category distinct from primitives (operations/substrate) and cross-cutting doctrines (lenses): modes are grammatical properties of how primitives operate, not separate elements. Parsimony at 7 primitives is preserved not as axiom but as earning-test outcome. "Encounter" (federation events generating constructed capacity) flagged as legitimate future primitive-admission candidate requiring its own ADR, not bundled here. Rewilding thesis (Johar, "Power Is Rewilding," 2026 — institutional conditions of power losing alignment; power returning to the field) parked as Phase 3b.8 candidate pending maturation beyond speculation. Care as power-with infrastructure (Johar, "From Partnership to Power — And Back by Way of Care," 2026) acknowledged as deepening the ADR-0045 care-commoning doctrine; cross-reference prose only, no ADR-0045 modification.
docs/research/canon-decisions/0048-power-expressive-constructed-modes.md:116:- **Allocational mode**: three-layer decomposition (ADR-0047 Layer 1/2/3) covers the four capstone §3 structural modes (enumerated-powers, asymmetric-vulnerability, power-capture-via-ADR-0005-composition, relational-spiritual held under ADR-0001).
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-21-from-structural-violence-to-life-value-coherence-a-normative-framework-for.md:33:- **§3 The Structural Grammar of Pathology** (pp 10-12): §3.1 Institutionalization of Accumulation Logic, §3.2 Recursive Reproduction and Feedback Insulation
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-03-17-viability-geometry-a-minimal-relational-framework-for-persistence-in-complex.md:30:**Cluster role**: Wave-5 broader-cluster; **sister to Wave-1 sheaf-geometry-cluster anchor *From Entanglement to Governance*** (2026-04-02; per orchestrator dispatch description). **DISTINCTIVE MATHEMATICAL FORMALIZATION**: introduces the **Viability Grammar** as 7 informational roles (constraints / system-state / margins / disturbances / perception / regulation / optionality) organized via the **Fano plane / Steiner Triple System S(2,3,7)** with 7 canonical triadic relations. Connects to exceptional algebraic structures: **octonions** (Appendix C), **Freudenthal triple system** (Appendix D), and the **exceptional Lie group E_7 quartic invariant** (Appendix D). Authored 15 March 2026 (date in cover); two days after Trilogy Paper III publication — explicit shift from civilizational-scope phenomenology to **mathematical formalization across-domains**. Sister to Wave-3 #5 *Viability under Constraint* (foundational ontology) + Wave-2 anchor #3 *Architecture of Viability* (architectural form) + Wave-1 anchor *Entanglement-to-Governance* (sheaf-theoretic formalization).
