docs/research/canon-decisions/0054-rewilding-thesis-decline-with-triggers.md:53:ADR-0047 decomposes Power across three structural-asymmetry axes on existing primitives: authority-over-rule-levels on Field (Layer 1); asymmetric-commitment on Commitment (Layer 2); asymmetric-membrane on Membrane (Layer 3). ADR-0048 extends the treatment with two further modes-across-primitives — expressive-power and constructed-power — that together cover all four power-modes from capstone §3 (allocational / enumerated / asymmetric-vulnerability / relational-spiritual) plus Johar's three-form framework (allocational / expressive / constructed).
docs/research/canon-decisions/0054-rewilding-thesis-decline-with-triggers.md:94:**Trigger 1 — Federation-node institutional collapse.** An instance-family member (Octo / Dobby / BKC / PM / DW / other Spore-instance) experiences *sustained* institutional-structure failure — distinct from technical outage, key rotation, staffing gap, or temporary governance-process disruption — where the institutional frame no longer reliably holds, and Spore's grammar (as of the ADR-0054-era canon state) proves insufficient to coordinate through the collapse. "Sustained" means persistent across more than one coordination cycle; "institutional-structure failure" means the authority-over-rule-levels machinery from ADR-0047 Layer 1 stops transmitting. Evidence-class: field-report documenting the collapse + demonstrated grammar-insufficiency.
docs/research/canon-decisions/0054-rewilding-thesis-decline-with-triggers.md:136:- **R-Rewild-1 — Grammar-scope-condition articulation remains implicit.** ADR-0054 declines to introduce a canon-object-class for grammar-scope-conditions (Option D rejected on parsimony grounds). If the meta-gap category recurs — i.e., if additional meta-gaps emerge in future phases that are not primitive-admissions, doctrine-admissions, mode-admissions, property-admissions, or derived-glossary admissions — a future canon-review cycle may re-evaluate whether the meta-gaps / grammar-scope-conditions category earns admission by recurrence rather than single-candidate presence. Current single-candidate presence does not pass the earning-test for a new canon-object-class.
docs/research/canon-decisions/0054-rewilding-thesis-decline-with-triggers.md:152:- **ADR-0046** — Field rule-stratification, which ADR-0047 Layer 1 builds atop. The institutional-stratification machinery is the specific layer rewilding thesis claims is decoupling.
