docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-03-from-structure-to-practice-diagnosing-and-navigating-viability-in-the-real.md:28:**Provenance check**: Sahely-original (cover: "Dr. Bichara Sahely BSc Biology/MBBS/DM Internal Medicine + ChatGPT conceptual synthesis & structuring + Gemini figure generation"). Date 2 April 2026; book-format paper (159 pp; largest in Wave 5; subtitled "From Relational Grammar to Coherent Action Across Systems"). Not a repost.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-03-from-structure-to-practice-diagnosing-and-navigating-viability-in-the-real.md:30:**Cluster role**: Wave-5 broader-cluster; **OPERATIONALIZATION COMPANION** to Wave-5 #7 *Viability Grammar General Theory*. Sahely's own Preface (pp 17-18) explicitly positions this paper as continuation: "The first book established a claim... This work asks: How does coherence break? How can we detect it early? How do we act without making things worse?" — naming the previous-book as the established-claim foundation (Wave-5 #6 or #7; ambiguous but likely #7 given the title-language match "viability grammar"). **DISTINCTIVE CONTRIBUTIONS**: (i) **Navigation-vs-Control action mode** as proposed practice (Chapters 7-8); (ii) **Four Observable Signals of Emerging Failure**: path dependence + cross-channel divergence + increasing variability + delayed recovery (Chapter 6); (iii) **Obstruction Dashboard** practical diagnostic toolkit (Chapter 6); (iv) **Full 7-role × 7-triad application** across 4 domain chapters (9 Medicine + 10 Ecology + 11 Economics + 12 Infrastructure — each chapter explicitly maps the 7 primitives and 7 triads to its domain); (v) **operational naming of 7 triads** with consistent triad-shape names: (X,D,R) Response Channel + (M,D,P) Early Warning + (C,P,R) Governance + (M,O,R) Adaptive Capacity + (X,P,O) Perception–Possibility Mapping + (C,D,O) Pressure vs Possibility + (C,M,X) Geometry of Viability. **DISTINCTIVE METHOD-PRECEDENT**: bridges abstract grammar to operational practice — answer to the audit-then-propose discipline at full paper-length scope.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-04-03-from-structure-to-practice-diagnosing-and-navigating-viability-in-the-real.md:126:- **WAVE-5 OPERATIONALIZATION ANCHOR** — pair-mate to Wave-5 #7 *Viability Grammar General Theory*. Together {#7, #8} are the formal-substrate-AND-operational-practice anchor pair for Sahely's body-of-work. Wave-5 #6 {Viability Geometry math} + Wave-5 #7 {General theory} + Wave-5 #8 {Practice} are **a deliberate 3-paper series** (cover dates 14-15-16 March + 2 April 2026 with publication on 17-19 March + 3 April) representing math → theory → practice progression.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-02-12-the-cost-of-staying-alive-how-living-systems-budget-survival-remember.md:30:**Cluster role**: Wave-4 broader-cluster; **viability-budget substrate**. Published 1 day after Wave-4 #5 *Grammar of Viability: Mind, Self, Meaning* and same day as Wave-3 #4 *Unifying Grammar of Viability*. Develops claim #7 from Wave-4 #5's seven-central-claims list — "Collapse is delayed feedback, not surprise" — into a full **budgetary framework**: chronic disease, trauma, and inflammation as accumulated cost of remaining-viable-under-sustained-constraint. Treats **trauma as forced liquidation of optionality**.
docs/research/corpus-review/originals/sahely-extractions/2026-05-14-an-economy-answerable-to-life-beyond-gdp-unequal-exchange-and-the-life-coherent-reordering-of-progress.md:37:12 sections + Back Matter (Appendix A Key Terms + Appendix B Hickel-to-Life-Coherent Translation Table + Appendix C Proposed Life-Coherent Progress Dashboard + References + Author Bio + Back Cover Synopsis). **§1**: Introduction "When the Compass Is Not Enough". **§2**: Double Crisis (overshoot amid deprivation). **§3**: GDP as Symptom (the accounting form of a deeper inversion). **§4**: Hickel's Engine-Room Diagnosis (capitalist law of value). **§5**: Unequal Exchange as Cross-Border Life-Drain. **§6**: Degrowth Reinterpreted as Differentiated Life-Coherent Convergence. **§7**: McMurtry, Galtung, Maturana, and Hickel — Toward a Fourfold Synthesis. **§8**: From Indicators to Institutions (why dashboards need power). **§9**: Toward a Life-Coherent Progress Dashboard. **§10**: Small Island States and the Caribbean as Diagnostic Sites. **§11**: Extending Hickel through a Life-Coherent Grammar. **§12**: Conclusion: The Life-Coherent Reordering of Progress.
